<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your cart is waiting</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body p { margin-top: 0; }
    .item { display: flex; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f0eb; padding: 12px 0; }
    .item img { width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 6px; object-fit: cover; }
    .item-info { flex: 1; }
    .item-name { margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #1a1a1a; }
    .item-meta { margin: 0; color: #6b5a4e; font-size: 13px; }
    .btn { display: block; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 15px 28px;
           border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-align: center;
           margin: 28px 0; font-size: 15px; }
    .note { color: #6b5a4e; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; margin: 0; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; color: #7a5c45; font-size: 12px; }
    .footer a { color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 Daily Daisy</h1>
      <p>Your cart is waiting for you 🛍️</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p style="font-size: 16px;">
        Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>, you left items in your cart.
        Each piece is handmade to order — we&rsquo;re holding them a little longer.
      </p>

      {{#each items}}
      <div class="item">
        {{#if this.imageUrl}}
        <img src="{{this.imageUrl}}" alt="{{this.name}}" />
        {{/if}}
        <div class="item-info">
          <p class="item-name">{{this.name}}</p>
          <p class="item-meta">Qty: {{this.quantity}} &middot; ${{this.price}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{/each}}

      <a href="{{cartUrl}}" class="btn">Return to my cart &rarr;</a>

      <p class="note">
        Personalized items are made to order — your cart is saved but availability
        is not guaranteed indefinitely.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Daily Daisy. All rights reserved.<br />
      <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Unsubscribe from cart reminders</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
